Apply the exact gate to IdentityJudgment: Same-entity judgments require compatible identity evidence, not shared names alone. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
